::meta{plain.key: "2", "tmtroot/schema/rust.vocabulary.tmt": ../vocabularies/rust.vocabulary.tmt, "with space": "1"}

=[Quoted map keys]
A key that is not an identifier is written as a quoted string.
@ns.thing("a/b.tmt": 1, plain: 2)[]
@ns.thing[]{ "a/b": {"c d": 3} }
A quoted string with no `:` after it is still a value, not a key.
@ns.thing[]{ value: a/b.tmt }
